@startuml
!include style.iuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
hide footbox
hide unlinked
skinparam ParticipantPadding 4
skinparam BoxPadding 0
skinparam sequence {
  MessageAlign left
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #E6E6E6
}
' UC-10 Supervise Exam Live (M10). Built from seq_telemetry (live pushes) and seq_view_database(_b) (timeline);
' actions from Backend_API/Hubs/MonitoringHub.cs (JoinExamGroup, SendWarning, ForceSubmitSessionById: access via
' ExamAccessService, notification + PROCTOR_WARNING_SENT / SESSION_FORCE_SUBMITTED audit) and
' MonitoringController.Heartbeat (ack carries warnings and sessionStatus; the WPF client has no SignalR link).
' Web: Admin_Web_Panel/src/pages/teacher/LiveMonitorPage.tsx. Client: LiveMonitoringService, ExamWindow.OnServerSessionStatus.

actor Invigilator as I
participant "Live Monitor\npage (web)" as WEB
participant "Server" as SRV
database "Database" as DB
participant "Desktop App\n(student PC)" as APP

I -> WEB : open Live Monitor,\npick an exam
activate WEB
WEB -> SRV : load live board;\njoin the exam's group
activate SRV
SRV --> WEB : one tile per student (only for the\nowner, an assigned invigilator or admin)
deactivate SRV
loop during the exam
  SRV ->> WEB : heartbeat, violation, capture\nand disconnect updates (UC-05)
end
opt open a student's tile
  WEB -> SRV : get timeline and captures
  activate SRV
  SRV --> WEB : events, captures, warnings\nand incidents, newest first
  deactivate SRV
end
alt send a warning
  I -> WEB : warning text
  WEB -> SRV : send warning
  activate SRV
  SRV -> DB : save warning\nand audit entry
  deactivate SRV
  APP -> SRV : next heartbeat
  activate SRV
  SRV --> APP : reply carries the warning;\nthe app shows it
  deactivate SRV
else force-submit
  I -> WEB : Force submit
  WEB -> SRV : force-submit session
  activate SRV
  SRV -> DB : submit as Force\nsubmitted; audit entry
  deactivate SRV
  APP -> SRV : next heartbeat
  activate SRV
  SRV --> APP : status Force submitted;\nthe app closes the exam
  deactivate SRV
end
note over WEB, APP
Extra time, unlock and relock reach
the desktop app in the same way.
end note
deactivate WEB
@enduml
